{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104120","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1910412001:1":{"text":"还要下潜？你们都疯了？！","source_cn":"还要下潜？你们都疯了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x181BCC84EDCF217C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910412002:1":{"text":"你想想一路上咱们都碰到了什么？！被当做养料，被半座城的浅海裔追逐，被不知道从哪里来的深海疯子袭击！","source_cn":"你想想一路上咱们都碰到了什么？！被当做养料，被半座城的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB176F796EDA1EC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910412003:1":{"text":"现在，又冒出个触手男叫咱去什么沉船？！","source_cn":"现在，又冒出个触手男叫咱去什么沉船？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21F1F7B739F6B583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910412004:1":{"text":"咱算是知道了，海里根本没有什么好人！大个子，别和他们走！","source_cn":"咱算是知道了，海里根本没有什么好人！大个子，别和他们走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495521201F176E2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1910412004":{"text":"咱算是知道了，海里根本没有什么好人！大个子，别和他们走！","source_cn":"咱算是知道了，海里根本没有什么好人！大个子，别和他们走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495521201F176E2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d